taurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","review_id":"Ywhh0wm69O_o_dDRiWb3lw","date":"2019-11-02T08:16:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9297118186950684,"text_excerpt":"When we left our hotel that day to go roam Nola, we didn't expect it to be a very blustery freezing day so we literally just hurried into the first place we saw and it was this place. I liked it but I'm still on the search for the best fried chicken. My friend de did say comparatively, they liked this fried chicken better than the fried chicken they had at Mother's. I lovvvvved the biscuits. We did see a cockroach I told my friends that it was Willie and this was his shack lmao. Corporate guy/owner was there and was very nice to us. A couple friends ordered dark meat but was told after ordering and paying that they were out of it so we mentioned it but all was fine in the end. It sufficed..."},{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","review_id":"w97RHpClJsIw3xbwzhXo3g","date":"2016-06-05T03:14:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.924676239490509,"text_excerpt":"quite possibly the best fried chicken I have ever had. the daiquiri bar looked interesting and the place looked a bit touristy but we were hungry, after a long flight, no breakfast etc. the biscuit was a sweet surprise and the chicken was amazing. they told us they were open till 2 or three am and I can say I bet this is one of the best hangover prevention cures... first meal in NOLA and was pleasantly suprised... only problem was a slow order line... other than that great service! Regarding my edit... three days in NOLA, THREE days here.first night was busy. .. the sauce is amAzing...."},{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","review_id":"fm1crxjk_Yl2-1RgrEJ2Eg","date":"2016-07-16T23:40:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.916037917137146,"text_excerpt":"My boyfriend and I stopped in the check out the famous Willie's Chicken. Someone should call it Willie's biscuits ! Those things are AMAZING!! They literally melt in your mouth!! Hot covered in butter and deliciousness!! My boyfriend and I had 10 piece Cajun sweet and sour wings and a biscuit. It was a great snack that may have us visiting again later tonight!! The fried chicken looked pretty awesome too!! If you ever in NOLA, give this place a try! You won't be disappointed!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","photo_id":"SU_oC3c1EyJGu2v8So-yGQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SU_oC3c1EyJGu2v8So-yGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9415313005447388},{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","photo_id":"ryGoVi3xCjUNRJ98gmxwTQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ryGoVi3xCjUNRJ98gmxwTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8476033210754395},{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","photo_id":"tcFMaioDqE9SP8WGChR1LA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tcFMaioDqE9SP8WGChR1LA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8267525434494019},{"business_id":"ArPLE_RTg0h7yzkN0KwzRg","photo_id":"jaos9H37LKVtuMZ7pD1XAw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jaos9H37LKVtuMZ7pD1XAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.818891704082489}]},"notebook_case":null}
